  <text id="title" x="40" y="105" width="1120" height="48" font="heading" size="34" color="paper" wrap="false">One scoped preference boundary</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="40" y="160" width="1100" height="30" font="body" size="18" color="muted">The new controls extend an existing company- and user-scoped JSON preference record; no parallel dashboard persistence model was introduced.</text>
